fo:font-size="16pt" style:font-size-asian="16pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T26" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="16pt" style:font-size-asian="16pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T27" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="13pt" style:font-size-asian="13pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T28" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="13pt" style:font-size-asian="13pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T29" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="13pt" style:font-size-asian="13pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T30" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="13pt" style:font-size-asian="13pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T31" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="13pt" style:font-size-asian="13pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T32" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="16pt" style:font-size-asian="16pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T33" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="16pt" style:font-size-asian="16pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T34" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="13pt" style:font-size-asian="13pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T35" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="13pt" style:font-size-asian="13pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T36" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="16pt" style:font-size-asian="16pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T37" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="13pt" style:font-size-asian="13pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T38" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="13pt" style:font-size-asian="13pt"/></style:style><style:style style:name="T39" style:parent-style-name="DefaultParagraphFont" style:family="text"><style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold" style:font-weight-asian="bold" fo:font-size="16pt" style:font-size-asian="16pt"/></style:style></office:automatic-styles><office:body><office:text text:use-soft-page-breaks="true"><text:p text:style-name="P1"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Middle School Portal — Copilot Build Spec</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"><text:line-break/>(Spring Boot + Angular + MongoDB)</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal"/><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T4">Version: 1.0</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5"><text:line-break/>Date: 2026-05-09</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6"><text:line-break/>Audience: Developers using Microsoft/GitHub Copilot (IntelliJ)</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T7">1) Project Overview</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal">Build a responsive web application (desktop + mobile) for a single middle school. The portal supports registration, homework viewing/submission, document storage, quizzes, announcements, dashboards by role, authentication/authorization, email notifications, and audit logging.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T8">Tech Stack</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Backend: Spring Boot 3 (Java 17), REST API, Spring Security</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Database: MongoDB</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Auth: JWT access tokens + refresh tokens</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Email: Spring Mail (SMTP)</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">File storage: abstraction supporting Local (dev) and MinIO/S3/Azure (prod)</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Frontend (later): Angular (TypeScript), responsive design</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T9">2) Users, Roles, and Access Rules (RBAC)</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T10">Roles</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">ADMIN</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">TEACHER</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">STUDENT</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">GUARDIAN</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T11">Key Access Rules</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Student can access only their homework, submissions, quizzes, announcements, and documents allowed for them.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Guardian can access only data for linked student(s) (homework status, submissions, documents, announcements).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Teacher can access classes they teach; create homework/quizzes/announcements; view submissions for their class.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Admin can manage all users/classes/enrollments; upload documents; post school announcements; view audit logs.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:soft-page-break/><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T12">Required Ownership Checks (beyond roles)</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Guardian endpoints must validate guardian↔student linkage.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Student endpoints must validate record ownership (studentId matches logged-in student).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Teacher endpoints must validate teacher ownership/assignment of the class.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T13">3) Core Features (Functional Requirements)</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T14">A) Authentication &amp; Account Management</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Login via email + password.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">JWT access token (short-lived) + refresh token (longer-lived).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Logout revokes refresh token.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Password reset flow: request reset link + reset with token.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Admin can create initial accounts for teachers/students/guardians.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T15">B) Student + Guardian Linking</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Admin creates student and guardian users and links guardian(s) to student(s).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Student and Guardian can log in independently.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T16">C) Homework</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal">Teacher:</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Create homework (title, description, classId, dueDate, optional attachments).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">List homework by class.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">View submissions for a homework.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Provide feedback and mark grade/status (optional for MVP).</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal">Student:</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">View homework assigned to their class.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Submit homework (text + optional file upload).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">View submission status.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal">Guardian:</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">View homework and submission status for linked student(s).</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T17">D) Documents Store</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Upload documents (PDF/images/docx).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Visibility scope: School-wide, Class-wide, Student-specific.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Downloads must be authorized server-side (role + ownership checks).</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T18">E) Quizzes</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Teacher creates quiz with questions (start with MCQ).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Define availability window and time limit.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Student takes quiz and submits answers; attempts and scores stored.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T19">F) Announcements</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Admin posts school-wide announcements.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Teacher posts class announcements.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Student/Guardian view announcements relevant to them.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T20">4) Non-Functional Requirements</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T21">Responsive UX</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Frontend must work on mobile and desktop.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Optimize key pages for small screens: Homework list/details, Announcements, Documents.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T22">Email Notifications (Required)</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Send emails when homework is posted.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Send emails when announcements are posted.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Optional: email when documents are uploaded.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Send homework due reminders (scheduled job).</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T23">Audit Logging (Required)</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal">Audit log must capture:</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Authentication events (login success/failure, logout, refresh).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Admin actions (create/update/delete users, link guardians, enrollments).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Teacher actions (create homework, create quiz, grade submissions).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Student actions (submit homework, quiz attempt).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Document actions (upload and download).</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal">Fields: timestamp, userId, role(s), action, entity/entityId, request path/method, IP address, user agent, optional details map.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T24">Security</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Password hashing: BCrypt.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Input validation: Bean Validation.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Protect endpoints by role + ownership checks.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Rate limit login attempts (optional enhancement).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">HTTPS in production.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T25">5) Suggested MongoDB Collections (Data Model)</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">users: id, email (unique), passwordHash, roles[], active, createdAt, lastLoginAt</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">students: id, userId, firstName, lastName, grade, classIds[], guardianIds[]</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">guardians: id, userId, studentIds[], relationship</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">teachers: id, userId, name, subject, classIds[]</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">classes: id, name, grade, teacherId, studentIds[]</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">homeworks: id, classId, title, description, dueDate, attachments[], createdByUserId, createdAt</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">submissions: id, homeworkId, studentId, text, files[], submittedAt, status, feedback, grade</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">documents: id, ownerType (SCHOOL|CLASS|STUDENT), ownerId, fileKey, fileName, mimeType, size, uploadedByUserId, uploadedAt</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">quizzes: id, classId, title, startAt, endAt, timeLimit, questions[]</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">quizAttempts: id, quizId, studentId, answers[], score, startedAt, submittedAt</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">announcements: id, scope (SCHOOL|CLASS), scopeId?, title, body, createdByUserId, createdAt</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">audit_logs: id, userId, action, entity, entityId, timestamp, path, method, ip, userAgent, details</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T26">6) API Contract (Initial Endpoints)</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T27">Auth</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/auth/login</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/auth/refresh</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/auth/logout</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/auth/forgot-password</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/auth/reset-password</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T28">Admin</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/admin/users (create teacher/student/guardian)</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">GET /api/admin/users</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/admin/classes</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/admin/enrollments (assign students to class)</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/admin/link-guardian (guardian↔student)</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/admin/announcements</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">GET /api/admin/audit (filter by date/user/action)</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T29">Teacher</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/teacher/homework</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">GET /api/teacher/homework?classId=...</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">GET /api/teacher/submissions?homeworkId=...</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/teacher/quizzes</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/teacher/announcements (class scope)</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/teacher/documents (optional)</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T30">Student</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">GET /api/student/homework</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/student/submissions</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">GET /api/student/announcements</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">GET /api/student/documents</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">POST /api/student/quiz-attempts</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T31">Guardian</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">GET /api/guardian/students</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">GET /api/guardian/homework?studentId=...</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">GET /api/guardian/documents?studentId=...</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">GET /api/guardian/announcements</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T32">7) Backend Implementation Guidelines (Spring Boot)</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Use packages: auth, security, audit, email, users, students, guardians, teachers, classes, homework, documents, announcements, quizzes.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">JWT subject = userId; claims include email and roles.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Refresh tokens stored in MongoDB and revocable.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Use @PreAuthorize for RBAC and enforce ownership checks in service layer.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">File upload: store metadata in MongoDB; store file in local/object storage; downloads require authorization.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Audit: request filter for request context + AOP aspect for actions + explicit logging for sensitive downloads.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Email: publish Spring events on key actions; listener resolves recipients and sends; scheduled job for due reminders.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T33">8) Acceptance Criteria (MVP)</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T34">Must Have</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Auth with JWT + refresh + logout.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Admin can create users and classes and link guardians/students.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Teacher can create homework for a class.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Student can view homework and submit a submission.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Guardian can view child homework status.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Announcements: admin school-wide, teacher class scope.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Documents: upload + authorized download.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Email notifications for homework and announcements.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Audit logging for login, create homework, submit homework, document download.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T35">Nice to Have (Next)</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Quiz module</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Grades/feedback UI</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Messaging</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Advanced search/pagination</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T36">9) Copilot Usage Notes (IntelliJ)</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal">Goal: Make this specification accessible to Copilot in IntelliJ (GitHub Copilot plugin).</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T37">Recommended approach</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Add this document to your repository under /docs/Copilot-Build-Spec.docx (and optionally /docs/Copilot-Build-Spec.md).</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">When chatting with Copilot in IntelliJ, open the spec file in the editor so Copilot can use it as context.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">For best results, copy the relevant section (e.g., API contract, data model) into the Copilot chat prompt when generating code.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">If your plugin supports “include open files” or context selection, ensure the spec is included.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T38">Suggested Copilot prompts</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO5" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListNumber">Using the build spec in /docs/Copilot-Build-Spec.docx, generate the Spring Boot security module with JWT access+refresh tokens and RBAC for ADMIN/TEACHER/STUDENT/GUARDIAN.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListNumber">Using the build spec, generate the homework module (models, repositories, service, controllers) with teacher create and student list, plus audit events and email event publishing.</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListNumber">Using the build spec, generate the documents module with upload + authorized download and audit logging for downloads.</text:p></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Normal"><text:span text:style-name="T39">10) Dev Environment Defaults</text:span></text:p><text:list text:style-name="LFO1" text:continue-numbering="true"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">MongoDB: mongodb://localhost:27017/school_portal</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">SMTP (dev): MailHog host localhost port 1025; UI http://localhost:8025</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="ListBullet">Storage (dev): local directory ./uploads</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></office:text></office:body></office:document-content>